@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### List all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/persons

### Create a fictional test contact
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"REST Test Contact","number":"040-1234567"}

### Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/info

### Set an actual id returned by POST before running these requests
@personId = replace-with-created-id

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/persons/{{personId}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/persons/{{personId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"REST Test Contact","number":"09-1234567"}

### Delete only the fictional test contact
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/persons/{{personId}}

### Validation failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ab","number":"1-234"}
